# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EXTERNAL / PROPRIETARY SCORERS — never commit
# An external scorer is resolved only from the BAC_SCORER_MODULE environment
# variable; this repository has no in-package slot for one. These patterns are
# a standing net for private engines that get parked in the working tree by
# accident. Open dig FLOW evals and claim evaluation are fine to ship.
# See PROPRIETARY_IP.md and the `separation` CI job.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

**/proprietary/**
!**/machines/proprietary/.gitignore
!**/machines/proprietary/README.md

**/external_scorer/**
**/private_score/**
**/patent/**
**/*_product_score_engine.py
**/*product*meal*score*.py
**/scoreModel.private.*
**/score_weights.private.*
**/score-axes.weights.private.json

# Product formula dumps / score system PDFs
**/*Score_System_Book.pdf
**/*Meal*Score*Formula*
**/*product*score*formula*

# Local private wheels / installs
*.whl
!# keep none of private wheels
vendor/private/
.private/

# Bulk export snapshots (never re-add to packaged fixtures)
**/fixtures/meals/off_products_snapshot.json
**/fixtures/meals/packets-for-sim.json
**/fixtures/meals/payloads-for-sim.json
**/fixtures/meals/FOOD_SUBSET_CLASSIFICATION.json
**/fixtures/meals/beverage_library.json


# Editor
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# MkDocs build output
site/

# Resolved ontology-term cache for check_curies.py. Machine-local and
# re-derivable; the durable artifact is curie_baseline.json.
.curie_cache/

# scripts/zenodo_new_version.sh build artifact
biology_as_code-v*.tar.gz

# ontology-sdk/learning-ont: the third-party talks and screenshots are reading
# material, not content this repository may redistribute. The notes (.md,
# .mermaid) written from them stay tracked. Untracked 2026-09-03.
ontology-sdk/learning-ont/*.pdf
ontology-sdk/learning-ont/*.png
ontology-sdk/learning-ont/*.jpg
